# The deploy unit is self-contained: keep the mirrored copies the build
# emits into deploy/ (Deno Deploy serves them next to deno-worker.js).
!deploy/artifacts/
!deploy/catalog-source.json
# This repository tracks no lockfile: its gates are dependency-free node
# scripts, and the untracked package-lock.json an `npm install` leaves behind
# (the CI type-ruler job installs) must never be committed by accident.
package-lock.json
